# NUMBER OF ORDERS PLACED ON SWIGGY IN DELHI IN A DAY

Bain Capability Network | ⬜⬜⬜⬜⬜

Click here to view detailed spreadsheet XLS

ASSUMPTIONS

1. Rural part of Delhi population will not prefer food delivery platforms
2. BPL population in the urban areas will not use food delivery platforms
3. Middle Income class population will place only 1 order and High Income class population will place 2 orders in a day.
4. Market Share of Swiggy is 40%

