          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "MECE",
        "children": [
          {
            "label": "A method for breaking down problems into mutually exclusive, collectively exhaustive categories to ensure completeness and prevent overlap. Example: Estimating the effectiveness of marketing campaigns as total impressions × conversion rate.",
