        "label": "UNIT ECONOMICS",
        "children": [
          {
            "label": "Break down the problem into individual units (e.g., per customer, per product) and scale up. Example: Estimating the total cost of running a delivery service by calculating the cost per delivery and multiplying by the number of deliveries.",
